      <header class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">04 — Writings</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">開発の裏側</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">note / Zenn / Qiita に書いた、設計の考えごと。</p>
      </header>

      <div class="writings-grid">
