        </a>

        <a href="https://qiita.com/kenzotakizawa/items/5fd64fbef79ddf09c3e0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="writing-card reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.16s">
          <div class="writing-meta">
